action pick_max takes a as whole number and b as whole number produces whole number
    keep r as whole number with value 0
    put a into r
    if b is greater than a then
        put b into r
    end if
    return r
end action

import from C the action apply_reduce takes opaque pointer and whole number and action taking A as whole number and B as whole number produces whole number produces whole number as reduce_with

program main
    keep xs as list of whole number with values 5, 3, 9, 1
    keep best as whole number with value 0
    call reduce_with with the address of xs and 4 and pick_max giving best
    print the text "max=" and best
end program
